  <h2>Earth from space</h2>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="cu4ZvCguhaw" data-title="Earth from Orbit 2019" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: Earth from Orbit 2019"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>Earth from Orbit: how NASA satellites picture Earth</h3><p>NASA · How a fleet of satellites builds a portrait of the whole planet every day.</p></div>
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="iWKZ0_1f6hw" data-title="NASA's Vantage Point Over Earth" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: NASA's Vantage Point Over Earth"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>NASA's vantage point over Earth</h3><p>NASA Goddard · From low orbit to the million-mile view of DSCOVR.</p></div>
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="3oIcJBiynvw" data-title="Our Living Planet From Space" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: Our Living Planet From Space"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>Our living planet from space</h3><p>NASA Goddard · Visualisations of the atmosphere, oceans and land in motion.</p></div>
