  <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">Maps &amp; GIS</h2>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="kIID5FDi2JQ" data-title="Why all world maps are wrong" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: Why all world maps are wrong"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>Why all world maps are wrong</h3><p>Vox · The classic explainer on projections. Pair it with our <a href="guides/map-projections-explained.html">projections guide</a>.</p></div>
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="ybXfc30a5XM" data-title="GIS concepts simplified" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: GIS concepts simplified"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>GIS concepts simplified</h3><p>Geography with Dave · Capture, store, analyse, display — the building blocks of GIS.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>New to GIS?</h3><p>Start with our plain-English <a href="guides/what-is-gis.html">What is GIS?</a> guide, then explore real projects on the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@esri" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Esri YouTube channel</a>. Have a GIS project? <a href="projects.html">Get matched with a specialist</a>.</p></div>
  </div>
  <h2 style="margin-top:2.5rem">Earthquakes &amp; plate tectonics</h2>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="Bs7u33DWOlw" data-title="What causes earthquakes" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: What causes earthquakes"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>What causes earthquakes?</h3><p>Big Think · Why plates stick, slip and shake the ground.</p></div>
    <div class="vid-card"><div class="vid" data-yt="RqqqSnaTfQo" data-title="How does an earthquake happen" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Play: How does an earthquake happen"><button type="button" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">▶</button></div><h3>How does an earthquake happen? (3D simulation)</h3><p>Let'stute · Faults and seismic waves visualised step by step.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Watch live, then learn</h3><p>See every quake from the last hour on the <a href="live.html">Live Earth map</a>, then read <a href="guides/earthquakes-explained.html">earthquake magnitude explained</a>.</p></div>
